OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration centre plan
OL,4,A'intensifying' public concern
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed expansion of an
OL,7,Fimmigration centre "risks perpetuating
OL,8,Fand intensifying" public concern around
OL,9,Fthe site, a local authority has said.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council has written
OL,12,Fto the Planning Inspectorate to object
OL,13,Fto plans to expand the Campsfield
OL,14,FImmigration Removal Centre near
OL,15,FKidlington.
OL,17,FThe Home Office is proposing to
OL,18,Fincrease the centre's capacity from 160
OL,19,Fbed spaces to 400, and convert existing
OL,20,Fbuildings.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
